# ── work.Brewfile — employer-issued machines only (work = true) ─────
# Tooling that belongs to the day job (cloud CLIs, policy engines, etc.).
# Work Macs' dotfiles-brew-sync appends here, so a `brew install` on one
# work Mac reaches the other work Macs and never a personal one.
# Prune freely: brew bundle never uninstalls.
